    "beat.abuela_mode.title": {
      "comment": "Demo screen: beat with the grandmother's simplified one-button mode. 'Abuela' is kept as a name in en. | es: Miami Spanish (US Spanish, usted where addressed), agent-authored; no human review record yet. | ht: Haitian Creole drafted by the myAD Language agent; not reviewed by a native speaker; must stay needs_review until a human native-speaker pass (decision D9).",
